WEBVTT

00:02:58.424 --> 00:03:03.262
The mouse has been virtually sliced
into 600 pieces from head to toe.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:07.683
It took only 12 seconds
to complete the whole body scan.

00:03:08.976 --> 00:03:11.520
It looks a little like a mouse carpaccio.

00:03:11.562 --> 00:03:13.314
(Laughter)

00:03:13.356 --> 00:03:15.983
But don't worry, no mice were hurt
during the imaging.

00:03:16.025 --> 00:03:17.193
(Laughter)

00:03:18.527 --> 00:03:20.112
In this next video,

00:03:20.112 --> 00:03:23.991
we hold the animal, another mouse,
in position to image its liver.

00:03:24.367 --> 00:03:26.827
The liver has a lot
of blood vessels inside.

00:03:26.869 --> 00:03:29.205
You can see them as a tree-like network.